OL,3,GNEWSAHe flayed England, but he should
OL,4,Ahave been playing for us
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe should have been playing for
OL,7,FCleethorpes in the Yorkshire Cricket
OL,8,FSouthern Premier League, but instead
OL,9,FRazaullah has become the newest star on
OL,10,Fthe international stage.
OL,12,FThe 21-year-old all-rounder had signed
OL,13,Ffor the North East Lincolnshire side
OL,14,Ffor the 2026 season but was called up
OL,15,Fto a Pakistan training camp in May.
OL,17,FAnd on his Test debut against England
OL,18,Fat Edgbaston last week, he hit nine
OL,19,Fsixes, scoring 81 off 63 balls for his
OL,20,Fcountry.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
